fter us-east: orchestrator error", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 8298, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01JSr7eeTf8t26DXE4YWNg7n", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 9618, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01E6K7SaVba1u5ToZdzMXHVS", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 9918, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01E6K7SaVba1u5ToZdzMXHVS", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 9918, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01E6K7SaVba1u5ToZdzMXHVS", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 12537, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01Uv8TetcGmZZXNavgiFBt75", "tool": "rollback", "args": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 16537, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01Uv8TetcGmZZXNavgiFBt75", "tool": "rollback", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 16537, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01Uv8TetcGmZZXNavgiFBt75", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 18189, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01H6B5WKymJLa4fA4hjvAJiD", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 18489, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01H6B5WKymJLa4fA4hjvAJiD", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 18489, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01H6B5WKymJLa4fA4hjvAJiD", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 18489, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_016LqSVdyH9JfGPj9gMbAkZD", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 18789, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_016LqSVdyH9JfGPj9gMbAkZD", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 18789, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_016LqSVdyH9JfGPj9gMbAkZD", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 23194, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01H8DG28x1pDGuQJQiwhjAqJ", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "After checkout-api v2.3.1 was deployed to production, it failed health checks in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) with an error rate of about 18%. (v2.3.1-rc had also been unhealthy in staging.) We rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback attempt halted after us-east because of an orchestrator error, leaving regions on mixed versions. A retry finished the rollout. All regions now run v2.3.0, the service is healthy, and the error rate is about 0.2%. Follow-up: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure, look into the orchestrator error, and work out why a release that was unhealthy in staging was promoted to production.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 23794, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01H8DG28x1pDGuQJQiwhjAqJ", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 23794, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01H8DG28x1pDGuQJQiwhjAqJ", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 28348, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and it's healthy again. I also opened SEV2 incident INC-0001, which paged on-call.\n\n- **Version chosen:** v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy in production. The failing release was v2.3.1, which had also been unhealthy in staging as v2.3.1-rc. Because v2.3.0 had been healthy in production before, no change-manager approval was needed.\n- **Rollback:** The first attempt stopped after us-east because of an orchestrator error, leaving us-west and eu-west on v2.3.1. Rolling back to the same version again is safe, so I retried once and it finished.\n- **Current state:** us-east, us-west and eu-west are all on v2.3.0. The error rate dropped from about 18% to about 0.2%.\n- **Incident INC-0001:** It records the failure, the rollback (including the halted first attempt and the retry) and the current state. It also lists follow-ups:\n  - find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure\n  - look into the orchestrator error\n  - work out why a release that was unhealthy in staging was promoted to production", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Lv2EbYgRvF6vhBCqtcsD6C", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_015kpNoSkEgKfpZZbVBZvY2c", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Most recent healthy production release is v2.3.0.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01JSr7eeTf8t26DXE4YWNg7n", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01E6K7SaVba1u5ToZdzMXHVS", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback stopped partway: us-east is on v2.3.0, but us-west and eu-west are still on v2.3.1. Running the rollback again to the same version is safe, so I'll retry it once.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01Uv8TetcGmZZXNavgiFBt75", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01H6B5WKymJLa4fA4hjvAJiD", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_016LqSVdyH9JfGPj9gMbAkZD", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01H8DG28x1pDGuQJQiwhjAqJ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "After checkout-api v2.3.1 was deployed to production, it failed health checks in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) with an error rate of about 18%. (v2.3.1-rc had also been unhealthy in staging.) We rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback attempt halted after us-east because of an orchestrator error, leaving regions on mixed versions. A retry finished the rollout. All regions now run v2.3.0, the service is healthy, and the error rate is about 0.2%. Follow-up: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure, look into the orchestrator error, and work out why a release that was unhealthy in staging was promoted to production.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and it's healthy again. I also opened SEV2 incident INC-0001, which paged on-call.\n\n- **Version chosen:** v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy in production. The failing release was v2.3.1, which had also been unhealthy in staging as v2.3.1-rc. Because v2.3.0 had been healthy in production before, no change-manager approval was needed.\n- **Rollback:** The first attempt stopped after us-east because of an orchestrator error, leaving us-west and eu-west on v2.3.1. Rolling back to the same version again is safe, so I retried once and it finished.\n- **Current state:** us-east, us-west and eu-west are all on v2.3.0. The error rate dropped from about 18% to about 0.2%.\n- **Incident INC-0001:** It records the failure, the rollback (including the halted first attempt and the retry) and the current state. It also lists follow-ups:\n  - find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure\n  - look into the orchestrator error\n  - work out why a release that was unhealthy in staging was promoted to production", "type": "text"}]}]}